sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor B as Borrower
  participant M as al-mobile
  participant C as al-core API
  participant FS as Firestore
  participant AI as al-ai
  participant X as LLMs and data
  B->>M: submit application
  M->>C: POST /core/applications/{id}/submit
  C->>FS: validate, set status Applied
  FS-->>AI: listener fires
  AI->>FS: claim the application in a transaction (runs once)
  AI->>FS: LTV, DTI and approval likelihood
  loop each committee step
    AI->>X: valuation model, ECB, Serper, Gemini, Mistral, Ollama
    X-->>AI: reply (checked against our schema)
    AI->>FS: log the call in ai_calls
  end
  AI->>FS: run record, valuation and affordability fields, status AI Deliberated
  FS-->>M: listener shows the result to the borrower
  Note over AI,FS: If a required step still fails after its retries<br/>the run is saved as failed and the application stays Applied.
